{
  "$schema": "../schema/cuedeck.schema.json",
  "cuedeck": 1,
  "title": "Project02 Demo",
  "target": "http://localhost:3002",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "準備",
      "notes": "> 先在 `project02-zipf-word2vec-ir/server` 跑 `npm run dev`，再按工具列的地球圖示啟動 Demo 用 Chrome。\n>\n> 講稿中的藍色小按鈕就是觸發點：講到那裡點一下（或按 Ctrl+Alt+→），頁面就會跟著動。",
      "cues": []
    },
    {
      "title": "開場",
      "notes": "大家好，今天 demo 的是 **Zipf 定律 + Word2Vec** 的檢索系統。\n\n{{開啟首頁}}",
      "cues": [
        {
          "label": "開啟首頁",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "goto",
              "url": "/"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "詞頻分布 Zipf",
      "notes": "先看前處理每一步對詞頻分布的影響。\n\n{{切到 Zipf 分頁}}\n\n- A → B 去標點：長尾變短\n- B → C 去停用詞：頭部最明顯\n\n{{看 B → C}}\n{{四組一起比}}\n\n接著疊上 Luhn 的上下切點，說明中間那一段才是有鑑別力的詞。\n\n{{疊上 Luhn 切點}}",
      "cues": [
        {
          "label": "切到 Zipf 分頁",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "click",
              "text": "詞頻分布 Zipf"
            },
            {
              "do": "scroll",
              "selector": "#step-switch",
              "align": "top"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "看 B → C",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "click",
              "selector": "#step-switch button[data-step=\"BC\"]"
            },
            {
              "do": "highlight",
              "selector": "#zipf-chart",
              "caption": "去停用詞後，頭部高頻詞明顯下降"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "四組一起比",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "click",
              "selector": "#step-switch button[data-step=\"ALL\"]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "疊上 Luhn 切點",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "click",
              "selector": "#luhn-toggle"
            },
            {
              "do": "scroll",
              "selector": "#luhn-panel"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "單詞統計",
      "notes": "{{查 osa 的 CF / DF / IDF}}",
      "cues": [
        {
          "label": "查 osa 的 CF / DF / IDF",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "scroll",
              "selector": "#term-input"
            },
            {
              "do": "type",
              "selector": "#term-input",
              "text": "osa"
            },
            {
              "do": "click",
              "selector": "#term-btn"
            },
            {
              "do": "wait",
              "ms": 600
            },
            {
              "do": "highlight",
              "selector": "#term-output",
              "caption": "CF / DF / IDF 一次看"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Word2Vec",
      "notes": "{{切到 Word2Vec}}\n\n查跟 insulin 最相近的詞，說明 Skip-gram 抓到的是語意鄰居。\n\n{{查 insulin 近鄰}}\n\n比較 Skip-gram 與 CBOW 的投影圖：\n\n{{切 CBOW}} {{切 t-SNE}}",
      "cues": [
        {
          "label": "切到 Word2Vec",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "flow",
              "name": "到W2V"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "查 insulin 近鄰",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "type",
              "selector": "#w2v-input",
              "text": "insulin"
            },
            {
              "do": "click",
              "selector": "#w2v-btn"
            },
            {
              "do": "wait",
              "ms": 800
            },
            {
              "do": "highlight",
              "selector": "#sim-list",
              "caption": "Skip-gram 找到的語意鄰居"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "切 CBOW",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "click",
              "text": "CBOW"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "切 t-SNE",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "click",
              "text": "t-SNE"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "檢索與拼字校正",
      "notes": "故意打錯字 diabetis，看系統怎麼校正。\n\n{{示範拼字校正}}",
      "cues": [
        {
          "label": "示範拼字校正",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "flow",
              "name": "搜尋示範"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "結語",
      "notes": "謝謝大家！{{回到頂端}}",
      "cues": [
        {
          "label": "回到頂端",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "scrollTo",
              "y": "top"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "flows": {
    "到W2V": [
      {
        "do": "click",
        "text": "詞向量 Word2Vec"
      },
      {
        "do": "wait",
        "ms": 300
      },
      {
        "do": "scroll",
        "selector": "#w2v-input",
        "align": "top"
      }
    ],
    "搜尋示範": [
      {
        "do": "click",
        "text": "檢索與拼字校正"
      },
      {
        "do": "type",
        "selector": "#search-input",
        "text": "diabetis"
      },
      {
        "do": "click",
        "selector": "#search-btn"
      },
      {
        "do": "wait",
        "ms": 1000
      },
      {
        "do": "highlight",
        "selector": "#search-output",
        "ms": 3000,
        "caption": "拼字校正後的檢索結果"
      }
    ]
  }
}
